WEBVTT

00:00:56.587 --> 00:01:00.044
kreću se preko ogromnog raspona veličina,

00:01:00.044 --> 00:01:02.460
otprilike 14 redova veličine,

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.951
od malih mikroskopskih čestica

00:01:04.951 --> 00:01:07.327
oko kojih se formiraju oblaci

00:01:07.327 --> 00:01:09.887
do veličine same planete,

00:01:09.887 --> 00:01:11.163
od 10 na minus šesti

00:01:11.163 --> 00:01:12.240
do 10 na osmi,

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.532
14 redova veličine u prostoru.

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:17.943
U vremenu, od milisekunda do milenijuma,

00:01:17.943 --> 00:01:20.998
i opet, oko 14 redova veličine.

00:01:20.998 --> 00:01:22.385
Šta to znači?

00:01:22.385 --> 00:01:24.324
Pa dobro, ako mislite na to kako

00:01:24.324 --> 00:01:26.984
da izračunate ove stvari,

00:01:26.984 --> 00:01:28.944
možete uzeti ono što vidite,

00:01:28.944 --> 00:01:29.970
OK, usitniću to

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.349
na mnogo malih kutijica,